@PhoenixWatcho_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### All available plans (with itemized billing)
GET {{PhoenixWatcho_HostAddress}}/api/plan
Accept: application/json

### Plan + expiry + billing for a subscriber (seeded active VC)
GET {{PhoenixWatcho_HostAddress}}/api/plan/subscriber/01234567890
Accept: application/json

